  "youtube": {
    "description": "it's 2001. mud on the windscreen, waterfalls everywhere and the jungle's louder than your engine. 🏁\nY2K drum & bass in the spirit of Rollcage Stage II and the PS1 racing era: breakbeats, rolling bass and that late 90s / early 2000s game soundtrack energy.\n\nPut it on for driving, gaming, coding, studying or just staring out the window pretending you're in a loading screen.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nTRACKLIST\n00:00 Mudslide Line\n01:57 Final Momentum\n04:14 Vine Transit\n06:29 Fern Gully Transit\n08:44 Canopy Protocol\n10:56 Humid Run\n13:13 Broken Kingfisher\n15:28 High Overgrowth\n17:45 Wet Season Run\n20:02 Monsoon Drive\n22:14 Hyper Riverbend\n24:30 Final Downpour\n26:45 Cold Waterfall\n28:58 Hinterland Circuit\n31:15 Downforce Loop\n33:30 High Redline\n35:44 Electric Rainmaker\n38:00 Deep Wheelspin\n40:16 Inertia Theory\n42:32 High Traction\n44:50 Treeline Sprint\n47:05 Kickdown Rush\n49:18 Burnout Theory\n51:32 Silent Turbo\n53:45 Afterburn Theory\n56:02 Undergrowth Transit\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🏎️ Visuals: Digital Aura Racing Team\n🎛️ Music: original tracks generated with custom Python scripts\n💿 Inspired by the sound of Rollcage Stage II and classic PS1 racers. Not affiliated with or endorsed by the original game or its publishers.\n\nIf this takes you back, drop your favourite old racing game in the comments and subscribe for more Y2K DnB.\n\n#y2kdnb #drumandbass #ps1",
